{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/steam-gif-1.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your fiend and battle endless hordes of enemies in this <strong>action-roguelike survivor</strong> game. Explore ever-changing stages, unlock new powerups and abilities, and grow stronger with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/steam-new-gif-3.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more playable characters in <strong>The Fiendonomicon</strong>! Each fiend offers a unique playstyle with a <strong>passive ability\u00a0</strong>and a set of <strong>4 active skills</strong>. Whether you prefer an aggressive, defensive, passive, or active approach, mastering your fiend's strengths is key to progressing through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/fiendrise-steam-gif-3.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage is randomly generated, offering new challenges every time. You'll find treasure chests, traps, powerful rewards guarded by enemies, and mysterious devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/fiendrise-steam-gif-4.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level up lets you choose 1 powerup from 3 options. Powerups come in two forms:<strong> Augmentations</strong>, which provide passive boosts, and <strong>Mutations</strong>, automatic weapons that trigger independently. Mix your fiend's abilities with different powerups to try new builds and wreak havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 playable characters, over 20 unique weapons, and much more: collect in-game currency to unlock additional content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique stages, each featuring its own enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack: every stage comes with its own exclusive music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless build possibilities: combine fiend abilities with power-ups to experiment with various builds and strategies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277650?t=1744875632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744875632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/f53f10d06b244203de4bb628a9ceb01a980ebf19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744875632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/f53f10d06b244203de4bb628a9ceb01a980ebf19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744875632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/steam-gif-1.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your fiend and battle endless hordes of enemies in this <strong>action-roguelike survivor</strong> game. Explore ever-changing stages, unlock new powerups and abilities, and grow stronger with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/steam-new-gif-3.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more playable characters in <strong>The Fiendonomicon</strong>! Each fiend offers a unique playstyle with a <strong>passive ability\u00a0</strong>and a set of <strong>4 active skills</strong>. Whether you prefer an aggressive, defensive, passive, or active approach, mastering your fiend's strengths is key to progressing through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/fiendrise-steam-gif-3.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage is randomly generated, offering new challenges every time. You'll find treasure chests, traps, powerful rewards guarded by enemies, and mysterious devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/extras/fiendrise-steam-gif-4.gif?t=1744875632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level up lets you choose 1 powerup from 3 options. Powerups come in two forms:<strong> Augmentations</strong>, which provide passive boosts, and <strong>Mutations</strong>, automatic weapons that trigger independently. Mix your fiend's abilities with different powerups to try new builds and wreak havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 playable characters, over 20 unique weapons, and much more: collect in-game currency to unlock additional content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique stages, each featuring its own enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack: every stage comes with its own exclusive music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless build possibilities: combine fiend abilities with power-ups to experiment with various builds and strategies.</p></li></ul>","developers":["starcrit"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277650/header.jpg?t=1744875632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085855,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085855/movie480.mp4?t=1744638424","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085855/movie_max.mp4?t=1744638424"},"name":"FIENDRISE - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257085855/3ab0bf0f7dab04fe8e75dbd4b1573a69163b4e0b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744638424","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085855/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744638424","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085855/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744638424"}}],"name":"FIENDRISE","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"FIENDRISE - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$3.99</span> $3.59 USD","packageid":1161215,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":359}],"title":"Buy FIENDRISE"}],"packages":[1161215],"pc_requirements":{"minimu